<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Pedido concluído</title>
<style>
  body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a}
  .wrap{max-width:600px;margin:40px auto;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.07)}
  .header{background:#437a22;padding:36px 40px;text-align:center}
  .header h1{color:#fff;margin:0;font-size:26px}
  .body{padding:40px}
  .body h2{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 12px}
  .body p{line-height:1.7;color:#444;margin:0 0 16px}
  .order-box{background:#f4f9f0;border:2px solid #437a22;border-radius:14px;padding:24px;margin:24px 0}
  .order-box .title{font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#437a22;margin-bottom:10px}
  .meta{background:#f9f9f7;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 20px;font-size:13px;color:#555;margin-bottom:24px}
  .meta div{padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eee}
  .meta div:last-child{border:none}
  .btn{display:inline-block;background:#437a22;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:50px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px}
  .footer{background:#f4f4f0;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#999}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="header">
    <h1>🎉 Pedido Concluído!</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="body">
    <h2>Olá, {{ user.name }}!</h2>
    <p>Seu pedido foi processado com sucesso. Confira os detalhes abaixo.</p>

    <div class="order-box">
      <div class="title">Pedido #{{ order.id }}</div>
      <strong>{{ order.service.name }}</strong><br>
      <span style="color:#666;font-size:14px">{{ order.service.category }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="meta">
      <div><strong>Quantidade:</strong> {{ order.quantity|number_format(0, ',', '.') }}</div>
      <div><strong>URL alvo:</strong> {{ order.targetUrl }}</div>
      <div><strong>Valor cobrado:</strong> R$ {{ (order.amountCents / 100)|number_format(2, ',', '.') }}</div>
      <div><strong>Status:</strong> Concluído</div>
      <div><strong>Data:</strong> {{ order.updatedAt ? order.updatedAt|date('d/m/Y H:i') : order.createdAt|date('d/m/Y H:i') }}</div>
    </div>

    <a href="{{ url('app_dashboard') }}" class="btn">Ver meu painel</a>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    &copy; {{ 'now'|date('Y') }} PulseSMM
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
